# SL-56: generator outputs stay LF in every checkout. packgen writes packs/, META-INF/sangam/ and sangam-packs/README.md,
# profilegen writes profiles/, both with LF, and packgen --check compares bytes (core.autocrlf=true checked out CRLF).
