sangam/sangam-packs/src/main/resources/META-INF/sangam/** text eol=lf
sangam/sangam-packs/src/main/resources/profiles/** text eol=lf
sangam/sangam-packs/README.md text eol=lf
# SL-56 (B4), one rule for every generator output: the generator writes LF (open(..., newline="\n")) and the file is
# "text eol=lf", so every checkout holds exactly the generator's bytes. Byte comparisons then agree on Windows and
# Linux (packgen --check: filecmp; E46 hashes); the text-mode checks (generate_native_config --check, CI regenerate +
# git diff --exit-code) agree as well. Hash-frozen fixtures that are not generated stay -text (acceptance/consumer/ifms/e46/.gitattributes).
